	 returning Saturday and Sunday\, November 7 and 8. Now in its 13th year\, 
	this annual self-guided tour offers a rare opportunity to step inside some
	 of Houston's most remarkable historic places and experience the city's ar
	chitectural heritage firsthand.\n\nhttps://www.preservationhouston.org/cal
	endar/2026/11/7/2026-good-brick-tour\n\nFrom Preservation Houston
